    {
      "id": "glass_taj_cistern_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Nothing on any chart of mine.” He is put out by it. “I have the whole watershed. There is no watershed. It has an outlet and no inlet, and I have three hundred years of wardens before me who all wrote *see previous* in that column.”"
        }
      ],
